know from birth, how to share.

00:22:55.040 --> 00:22:57.876
Being a single child, they don't
know how to share, you know,

00:22:57.909 --> 00:22:59.744
because that's exactly
what he's not doing at home.

00:22:59.777 --> 00:23:00.979
He's not sharing.

00:23:01.012 --> 00:23:02.647
That's why his
family hides from him.

00:23:02.680 --> 00:23:05.150
He isn't used to share
his space with anyone but

00:23:05.183 --> 00:23:06.851
