00:23:06.884 --> 00:23:11.423
Come on. Hey.
Come on. Come on.

00:23:11.456 --> 00:23:14.960
Let's go. Come on. Let's go.

00:23:16.127 --> 00:23:17.896
This is the part
that he's tense.

00:23:17.929 --> 00:23:21.032
Look. Come on.

00:23:21.065 --> 00:23:24.669
Hey. Come on.

00:23:24.702 --> 00:23:26.671
He's getting
super tense again.

00:23:30.174 --> 00:23:32.944
CESAR: I need him to imitate
the pack while he's here.

00:23:32.977 --> 00:23:35.547
You know, so if he's not
imitating the pack,

00:23:35.580 --> 00:23:39.083
