00:23:48.593 --> 00:23:51.129
That's why his humans are
hiding from him at home.

00:23:51.162 --> 00:23:53.231
For this entire rehab to work,

00:23:53.264 --> 00:23:56.768
Jax must learn what it feels
like to share his space

00:23:56.801 --> 00:23:59.604
and become connected
to me and my pack.

00:23:59.637 --> 00:24:00.972
Come on, come on.

00:24:01.005 --> 00:24:02.173
All right.

00:24:02.206 --> 00:24:04.042
Let's show him how we share
here at the DPC with a party

00:24:04.075 --> 00:24:05.143
