00:24:05.176 --> 00:24:06.878
Come on, guys.
Everybody in.

00:24:06.911 --> 00:24:08.847
Huffy, Benson, go.

00:24:08.880 --> 00:24:10.114
Go in.

00:24:10.147 --> 00:24:13.084
Find a spot.

00:24:13.117 --> 00:24:15.053
Stay. Stay.

00:24:15.086 --> 00:24:17.222
Sharing, he's sharing.

00:24:17.255 --> 00:24:19.758
Stay.

00:24:20.492 --> 00:24:23.862
He's tolerating everybody
