00:24:23.895 --> 00:24:26.731
But now that he's surrounded
by my pack's calm energy,

00:24:26.764 --> 00:24:30.135
I'm gonna start entering
his space by reaching
in to give him treats.

00:24:30.602 --> 00:24:32.170
So I'm focusing on
giving the reward.

00:24:32.203 --> 00:24:35.707
For example, I'm going
inside to give Benson a treat.

00:24:36.674 --> 00:24:38.510
To give Lola a treat.

00:24:38.543 --> 00:24:40.545
So that way, he'll see
that by staying calm and

00:24:40.578 --> 00:24:42.714
sharing space,
he gets the reward.

00:24:43.047 --> 00:24:45.817
There you go.
This is good.

00:24:45.850 --> 00:24:47.752
He's starting to
mirror their energy.

00:24:47.785 --> 00:24:49.721
He's calm and he's sharing.

00:24:49.754 --> 00:24:52.123
Finally, he gets a
piece because he's allowing

00:24:52.156 --> 00:24:55.159
everybody to be around
without him reacting.

00:24:55.192 --> 00:24:58.997
So that's really good
sign that he can share.

00:24:59.030 --> 00:25:01.699
Now that he's starting to
connect to me and my pack,

00:25:01.732 --> 00:25:04.769
okay, guys, come on, we
got a long week ahead to

00:25:04.802 --> 00:25:07.539
