00:25:14.945 --> 00:25:16.047
 NARRATOR: The goal is to
 overcome his confused angry

00:25:16.080 --> 00:25:19.951
 mindset by integrating
 the dog into Cesar's pack.

00:25:19.984 --> 00:25:22.554
