He's had some good moments.

00:25:24.121 --> 00:25:25.356
He's doing good.

00:25:25.389 --> 00:25:27.792
And we're overcoming a lot of
the confusion that he's faced.

00:25:27.825 --> 00:25:28.993
He's doing nose, eyes, ears,

00:25:29.026 --> 00:25:30.595
which is what he
should be doing.

00:25:30.628 --> 00:25:32.664
He's even starting to
become part of the pack.

00:25:32.697 --> 00:25:34.299
Yes, sir.
That's it.

00:25:34.332 --> 00:25:35.533
He's playing.

00:25:35.567 --> 00:25:38.636
But I also recognize that he's
still getting really frustrated.

00:25:38.669 --> 00:25:41.205
And while we try to
burn off that energy,

00:25:41.238 --> 00:25:44.709
literally, we're doing a
treadmill in the water.

00:25:44.742 --> 00:25:47.211
His frustration is still
causing unwanted behavior.

00:25:47.244 --> 00:25:49.280
No. Oh, that's not good.

00:25:49.313 --> 00:25:51.750
Bison, get away from Jax.

00:25:54.852 --> 00:25:56.921
It's a good day for us today.

00:25:56.954 --> 00:26:00.758
There is tremendous
improvement on his trust but

00:26:00.791 --> 00:26:03.361
we must address his
frustration, some of which is

00:26:03.394 --> 00:26:05.830
coming from his testosterone.

00:26:07.298 --> 00:26:11.169
So this testosterone triggers
him to practice owning,

00:26:11.202 --> 00:26:15.073
controlling people,
furniture, whatever it is.

00:26:16.741 --> 00:26:20.211
Some of his aggression
comes from him being intact.

00:26:20.711 --> 00:26:23.047
Neutering him will eliminate
the frustration of the sexual

00:26:23.080 --> 00:26:25.116
frustration that he has.

00:26:25.149 --> 00:26:28.620
Besides this particular case,
there's an overpopulation

00:26:28.653 --> 00:26:30.755
in America and in the world.

00:26:30.788 --> 00:26:33.191
So spay and neuter is a
responsibility that we

00:26:33.224 --> 00:26:35.126
dog lovers must follow.

00:26:35.159 --> 00:26:37.795
If you want puppies,
just go rescue one.

00:26:37.828 --> 00:26:40.231
So I need to talk to
Priscilla because

00:26:40.264 --> 00:26:42.967
I definitely want her blessing.

00:26:43.000 --> 00:26:44.936
And so my boy is ready.

00:26:44.969 --> 00:26:46.104
All right, Jax.

00:26:46.137 --> 00:26:48.807
Say goodbye to
