00:31:15.940 --> 00:31:18.376
PRISCILLA: Is this like
they should all be,
kind of, like away?

00:31:18.409 --> 00:31:20.344
CESAR: That's right.
PRISCILLA: Okay.
CESAR: That's right.

00:31:20.377 --> 00:31:21.512
DANIEL: You choose who's
getting fed, right? Right?

00:31:21.545 --> 00:31:22.746
CESAR: Right.
PRISCILLA: Okay.

00:31:22.780 --> 00:31:24.448
CESAR: Priscilla is letting
the animals crowd her because

00:31:24.481 --> 00:31:26.984
the energy she's
projecting is weak.

00:31:27.017 --> 00:31:29.086
If she doesn't start
projecting confidence,

00:31:29.119 --> 00:31:34.225
she'll never be able to claim
her space and Jax will go
back to protecting her.

00:31:37.161 --> 00:31:38.262
Stay confident.

00:31:38.296 --> 00:31:40.464
If you don't claim your space,
Jax will get anxious.

00:31:40.497 --> 00:31:41.499
(barking)

00:31:41.532 --> 00:31:43.434
Tsch.

00:31:43.600 --> 00:31:45.569
PRISCILLA: I feel like
